<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank sets no overnight repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank sets no overnight repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Friday  it did not allocate any overnight repurchase agreements.</p>
<p>Call money fell to 6.55 percent from 6.65 percent at the close Thursday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar fell to 0.99946 peso from 0.99981 peso Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
